\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces Image taken from \blx@tocontentsinit {0}\cite {RosenholtzRuth2007Mvc}, Page 3; It shows a comparison between reaction time and clutter to predict performance. The difficulty of the given task may also change the increase in reaction time compared to the clutter, therefore 3 curves are provided instead of one.}}{5}{figure.caption.7}%
